# A task added with Quick Add and opened in its own pane is taken away by undo, and that pane zooms out to the inbox.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
END
keys qi
type Buy milk
keys <Enter>
keys G <C-w> v
see 󰋜 › INBOX › Buy milk
keys g1 z
see │  󰋜 › INBOX
hide Buy milk
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
END
